  "paragraph": 12,
  "text": "The KV cache eliminates redundant math, but adds a second tax. Every output token appends another slice to VRAM, so the cache grows linearly with length. Worse, on every decode step, the GPU must read both the model weights and that growing KV cache across the exact same HBM bandwidth pipe.",
